abstract: "OmniJinja is a Visual Studio Code extension for Python/Jinja template development. It connects Python-side render context information with Jinja template editing and provides context-aware completion, hover information, definition navigation, template path completion, custom filter completion, signature help, and backend-informed diagnostics for Jinja templates."

